[internal] Error: src/Lower/LoopTransforms.cpp:210
loopify() is in the schedule, and this traversal walks a tree held in an element of another. Each level needs a stack of its own, and this pipeline has only the one it just made, at the Stmt level. Compile with `-p ssa`, where loopify gives every recursion its own stack.
